"``show_source``"
msgstr ""
"``show_copyright``\\ , ``show_sphinx``\\ , ``show_guidedog``\\ , "
"``has_source``\\ , ``show_source``"

#: ../../templates.rst:248
msgid "The ``html_show_*`` and ``html_copy_source`` settings."
msgstr "``html_show_*`` と ``html_copy_source`` の設定。"

#: ../../templates.rst:249
msgid "``builder``, ``file_suffix``"
msgstr "``builder``\\ , ``file_suffix``"

#: ../../templates.rst:250
msgid "The builder's name, such as ``html``, and the page suffix."
msgstr "``html`` などのビルダー名とページの拡張子。"

#: ../../templates.rst:251
msgid "every key of ``html_context``"
msgstr "``html_context`` の各キー"

#: ../../templates.rst:252
msgid ""
"Its value, with its type, as Sphinx passes a Python value: ``false`` is "
"false in ``{% if %}``, numbers are numbers, arrays are lists, and tables "
"are dicts whose keys keep the order ``conf.toml`` gives them. ``guidedog "
"migrate`` carries the literal entries of ``conf.py``'s ``html_context``; "
"a value ``conf.py`` computes is left undefined, which a template reads as "
"false."
msgstr ""
"型を保った値を、Sphinx が Python 値を渡すように渡す。\\ ``false`` は ``{% if %}`` "
"で偽、数値は数値、配列はリスト、テーブルは ``conf.toml`` のキー順を保つ辞書となる。\\ ``guidedog migrate`` "
"は ``conf.py`` の ``html_context`` のリテラルを引き継ぐ。計算値は未定義となり、テンプレートは偽と扱う。"

#: ../../templates.rst:258
msgid ""
"``pathto`` is Sphinx's template function. ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` "
"is the URL of a document's page, and ``pathto(\"_static/logo.svg\", 1)`` "
"the URL of a file below the site's root, both relative to the current "
"page. With the singlehtml builder, as with Sphinx's, a document is its "
"section of the single page: ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` is "
"``#document-usage-install`` on that page and "
"``index.html#document-usage-install`` on the index and search pages. A "
"name that is no document's, such as ``genindex`` or a page made from a "
"template (below), is a page at the site's root with every builder."
msgstr ""
"``pathto`` は Sphinx のテンプレート関数。\\ ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` は文書ページ、\\ "
"``pathto(\"_static/logo.svg\", 1)`` はサイト配下のファイルの URL "
"を現在のページからの相対で返す。singlehtml では Sphinx 同様、文書は一ページの節となる。前者はそのページでは "
"``#document-usage-install``\\ 、索引や検索では "
"``index.html#document-usage-install``\\ 。\\ ``genindex`` "
"やテンプレートページなど文書以外の名前は、どのビルダーでもサイト直下のページを指す。"

#: ../../templates.rst:266
msgid "Pages made from templates"
msgstr "テンプレートから作るページ"

#: ../../templates.rst:269
msgid ""
"``html_additional_pages`` makes pages from a template alone, as in "
"Sphinx. Each key is a page's name and each value a template in "
"``templates_path``:"
msgstr ""
"``html_additional_pages`` は Sphinx 同様、テンプレートだけでページを作る。キーはページ名、値は "
"``templates_path`` 内のテンプレート。"

#: ../../templates.rst:273
msgid "conf.toml"
msgstr "conf.toml"

#: ../../templates.rst:281
msgid ""
"A page's template usually extends ``layout.html`` and fills its blocks, "
"so the page looks like every other one:"
msgstr "通常は ``layout.html`` を継承してブロックを埋め、他のページと見た目を揃える。"

#: ../../templates.rst:285
msgid "_templates/indexcontent.html"
msgstr "_templates/indexcontent.html"

#: ../../templates.rst:294
msgid ""
"The template sees the variables of a page that is no document's: "
"``pagename`` is the page's name (``index``), ``title`` and ``body`` are "
"empty, and ``pathto``, ``toc``, ``toctree()``, and the values of "
"``html_context`` work as on any page. The page is written at the site's "
"root as ``<name>.html`` (``html_file_suffix``) by ``html``, ``dirhtml``, "
"and ``singlehtml``, and written again on every build; a change to its "
"template, as to any file in ``templates_path``, rebuilds every page."
msgstr ""
"文書でないページの変数が渡る。\\ ``pagename`` はページ名（\\ ``index``\\ ）、\\ ``title`` と "
"``body`` は空。\\ ``pathto``\\ 、\\ ``toc``\\ 、\\ ``toctree()``\\ 、\\ "
"``html_context`` は通常通り使える。\\ ``html``\\ 、\\ ``dirhtml``\\ 、\\ "
"``singlehtml`` は全てサイト直下に ``<name>.html``\\ （\\ ``html_file_suffix``\\ "
"）として毎回書く。テンプレート、または ``templates_path`` のどのファイルの変更も全ページを再構築する。"

#: ../../templates.rst:301
msgid "Where the page goes, and where it differs from Sphinx:"
msgstr "ページの配置と Sphinx との差分は次のとおりです。"

#: ../../templates.rst:303
msgid ""
"A page named as a document takes that document's place, as in Sphinx, "
"where it is written last: ``index = \"landing.html\"`` makes the landing "
"page ``index.html`` while ``index.rst`` still gives the table of contents "
"its entries. With ``singlehtml`` the single page keeps its place and the "
"template page is not written, with a warning."
msgstr ""
"同名の文書ページを置き換える。Sphinx で最後に書くのと同じだ。\\ ``index = \"landing.html\"`` は "
"``index.html`` をランディングページにし、目次は引き続き ``index.rst`` から作る。singlehtml "
"では単一ページを残し、テンプレートページを警告付きで省く。"

#: ../../templates.rst:307
msgid ""
"``dirhtml`` writes the page as ``download.html``, beside "
"``genindex.html`` and ``search.html``, where Sphinx writes "
"``download/index.html``; ``pathto(\"download\")`` gives that file."
msgstr ""
"``dirhtml`` は ``genindex.html`` や ``search.html`` と並ぶ ``download.html`` "
"に書く。Sphinx の ``download/index.html`` とは異なる。\\ ``pathto(\"download\")`` "
"はそのファイルを返す。"

#: ../../templates.rst:310
msgid ""
"A name must be a file name at the site's root: ``\"sub/page\"`` is "
"refused with a warning (``build.additional_page``), since the page's "
"links are made from the root. So is a name whose file the site already "
"has, such as ``genindex``, where Sphinx would write one of the two over "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"名前はサイト直下のファイル名に限る。リンクがルート基準なので ``\"sub/page\"`` は警告（\\ "
"``build.additional_page``\\ ）で拒否する。\\ ``genindex`` など既存ファイル名も拒否する。Sphinx "
"では一方を上書きする場合だ。"

#: ../../templates.rst:314
msgid ""
"``guidedog migrate`` carries ``html_additional_pages`` over from "
"``conf.py``."
msgstr ""
"``guidedog migrate`` は ``conf.py`` の ``html_additional_pages`` を移します。"

#: ../../templates.rst:316
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "エラー"

#: ../../templates.rst:319
msgid ""
"A mistake in a template stops the build with the template's file and "
"line, the line itself, and a suggestion:"
msgstr "テンプレートの誤りはビルドを止め、ファイル、行番号、該当行、修正案を示します。"

#: ../../templates.rst:330
msgid "A variable that is not defined renders as nothing, as in Jinja."
msgstr "未定義の変数は Jinja と同様に何も表示しません。"

#: ../../templates.rst:332
msgid ""
"Runaway templates stop with an error too, never a crash: syntax nested "
"more than 100 levels deep (brackets, tags, and each link of a long chain "
"of operators, filters or ``elif`` branches), macros, includes and "
"recursive loops more than 200 deep, or any recursion needing more than "
"512 KiB of stack. A list that contains itself prints as ``[...]``, as in "
"Python."
msgstr ""
"暴走するテンプレートもクラッシュせずエラーで停止する。構文（括弧、タグ、演算子・フィルター・\\ ``elif`` "
"の連鎖）が100段、マクロ・インクルード・再帰ループが200段を超える場合、または再帰が512 "
"KiB以上のスタックを要する場合だ。自身を含むリストは Python 同様 ``[...]`` と表示する。"

#: ../../templates.rst:339
msgid "PDF templates"
msgstr "PDF テンプレート"

#: ../../templates.rst:342
msgid ""
"The PDF book is typeset by Typst. ``_templates/book.typ`` is an ordinary "
"Typst file that defines a ``book`` function; Guidedog writes the book's "
"source as"
msgstr ""
"PDF は Typst で組版する。\\ ``_templates/book.typ`` は ``book`` 関数を定義する通常の Typst "
"ファイル。Guidedog は次の形でソースを書く。"

#: ../../templates.rst:352
msgid ""
"so everything that decides how the book looks is in that file: fonts, "
"page size and margins, headings, the title page, running heads, and the "
"table of contents."
msgstr "本の見た目を決める要素はすべてそのファイルにあります。フォント、用紙と余白、見出し、扉、柱、目次です。"

#: ../../templates.rst:355
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../templates.rst:362
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../templates.rst:365
msgid "The book's ``title`` in ``pdf_documents``, otherwise ``project``."
msgstr "``pdf_documents`` の本の ``title``\\ 、なければ ``project``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:366
msgid "``author``"
msgstr "``author``"

#: ../../templates.rst:367
msgid "The book's ``author``, otherwise ``author``."
msgstr "本の ``author``\\ 、なければ設定の ``author``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:368
msgid "``version``"
msgstr "``version``"

#: ../../templates.rst:369
msgid "``release``."
msgstr "``release``\\ ."

#: ../../templates.rst:370
msgid "``date``"
msgstr "``date``"

#: ../../templates.rst:371
msgid ""
"``|today|``: ``today`` when it is set, otherwise the build date in "
"``today_fmt``."
msgstr "``|today|`` は ``today`` の設定値、なければ ``today_fmt`` 形式のビルド日付です。"

#: ../../templates.rst:372
msgid "``lang``"
msgstr "``lang``"

#: ../../templates.rst:373
msgid "``language``."
msgstr "``language``\\ ."

#: ../../templates.rst:374
msgid "``paper``"
msgstr "``paper``"

#: ../../templates.rst:375
msgid ""
"``\"a4\"``, or ``\"us-letter\"`` when ``pdf_paper_size`` is ``letter``."
msgstr ""
"``\"a4\"``\\ 、または ``pdf_paper_size`` が ``letter`` なら ``\"us-letter\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:376
msgid "``numbering``"
msgstr "``numbering``"

#: ../../templates.rst:377
msgid "``true`` when a toctree has the ``numbered`` option."
msgstr "toctree に ``numbered`` があれば ``true``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:378
msgid "``logo``"
msgstr "``logo``"

#: ../../templates.rst:379
msgid "The path of ``pdf_logo``; absent when it is unset."
msgstr "``pdf_logo`` のパス。未設定なら省きます。"

#: ../../templates.rst:380
msgid "``copyright``"
msgstr "``copyright``"

#: ../../templates.rst:381
msgid ""
"``copyright``, for the colophon; passed only to a template that takes it."
msgstr "奥付用の ``copyright`` です。この引数を受け取るテンプレートにだけ渡します。"

#: ../../templates.rst:383
msgid "The chapters."
msgstr "各章の内容。"

#: ../../templates.rst:385
msgid ""
"A template may add parameters with defaults of its own. The template "
"quickstart writes has ``accent``, the fonts ``serif``, ``sans``, and "
"``mono``, the text ``size``, and ``page-ref``, which follows "
"cross-references to other pages with their page number when set to a "
"function such as ``n => [p. #n]``."
msgstr ""
"テンプレートは既定値付きの引数を追加できる。quickstart のものには ``accent``\\ 、フォント ``serif``\\ ・\\ "
"``sans``\\ ・\\ ``mono``\\ 、文字の ``size``\\ 、\\ ``page-ref`` がある。最後を ``n => "
"[p. #n]`` などの関数にすると、他のページへの参照にページ番号が付く。"

#: ../../templates.rst:390
msgid "Modular Typst templates"
msgstr "Typst テンプレートの分割"

#: ../../templates.rst:393
msgid ""
"Like HTML templates, Typst templates are not restricted to a single file. "
"You can break book styling, macros, and custom covers into multiple "
"modular ``.typ`` files under ``_templates/`` and compose them using "
"standard Typst ``#import`` and ``#include`` statements:"
msgstr ""
"Typst も一つのファイルにまとめる必要はありません。スタイル、マクロ、表紙を ``_templates/`` の ``.typ`` "
"ファイルに分け、``#import`` と ``#include`` で組み合わせられます。"

#: ../../templates.rst:398
msgid "_templates/book.typ"
msgstr "_templates/book.typ"

#: ../../templates.rst:420
msgid ""
"Here ``apply-styles(body)`` must apply its rules around the content it "
"receives. A helper that sets text and returns nothing cannot change its "
"caller's later body. The complete tutorial shows a working wrapper around "
"the generated book template."
msgstr ""
"``apply-styles(body)`` "
"は受け取った内容を規則の内側に置く必要があります。文字設定だけをして何も返さない関数では、呼び出し元の後続本文は変わりません。完全な手順では、生成した書籍を包む動作する例を示します。"

#: ../../templates.rst:424
msgid "What a template can use"
msgstr "テンプレートで使えるもの"

#: ../../templates.rst:427
msgid "Typst packages"
msgstr "Typst パッケージ"

#: ../../templates.rst:428
msgid ""
"``#import \"@preview/cetz:0.4.2\"`` and other packages work, downloaded "
"on first use. Set ``pdf_packages = \"offline\"`` to build only with "
"packages already on disk."
msgstr ""
"``#import \"@preview/cetz:0.4.2\"`` などのパッケージは初回にダウンロードして使える。\\ "
"``pdf_packages = \"offline\"`` ならディスク上のものだけでビルドする。"

#: ../../templates.rst:431
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "フォント"

#: ../../templates.rst:432
msgid ""
"The system's fonts are available, as with the ``typst`` command. Add "
"folders with ``pdf_font_paths``, or set ``pdf_fonts = \"embedded\"`` to "
"use only the fonts built into Typst, for byte-for-byte reproducible books."
msgstr ""
"``typst`` と同様にシステムフォントを使える。\\ ``pdf_font_paths`` でフォルダーを追加する。\\ "
"``pdf_fonts = \"embedded\"`` なら Typst 内蔵だけを使い、バイト単位で再現可能な本を作れる。"

#: ../../templates.rst:436
msgid "A preamble"
msgstr "プリアンブル"

#: ../../templates.rst:437
msgid ""
"``pdf_preamble`` names a Typst file whose content follows the ``#show: "
"book`` line, which suits a few ``set`` and ``show`` rules without a "
"template of your own."
msgstr ""
"``pdf_preamble`` は ``#show: book`` の後に挿入する Typst ファイルです。独自テンプレートを作らずに、少数の "
"``set``\\ ・\\ ``show`` 規則を追加できます。"

#: ../../templates.rst:440
msgid "Typst in a document"
msgstr "文書内の Typst"

#: ../../templates.rst:441
msgid ""
"Documents are reStructuredText and Markdown; Typst files are not "
"documents. To put Typst markup into the book, write it in a raw block, "
"which web pages leave out:"
msgstr ""
"文書は reStructuredText と Markdown で、Typst ファイルは文書ではない。書籍に Typst 記法を入れるには "
"raw ブロックを使う。Web ページでは省かれる。"

#: ../../templates.rst:450
msgid ""
"``.. only:: pdf`` keeps ordinary content to the book in the same way."
msgstr "``.. only:: pdf`` も通常の内容を本だけに限定します。"

#: ../../templates.rst:452
msgid ""
"When Typst reports an error, the build names the file and line, whether "
"it is in your template or in the generated book. Each PDF has its own "
"generated source at ``_build/pdf/sources/<pdf-filename>.typ``. For "
"example, ``reference-en.pdf`` has ``sources/reference-en.pdf.typ``. A "
"single-book build also keeps the familiar "
"``_build/pdf/book-<language>.typ`` inspection copy. A failed build "
"publishes nothing. Its source remains in ``_build/.doctrees/failed`` at "
"the path named by the error. Several books keep distinct failure sources."
msgstr ""
"Typst のエラーは、テンプレートでも生成ソースでもファイルと行を示す。各 PDF のソースは "
"``_build/pdf/sources/<pdf-filename>.typ``\\ 。\\ ``reference-en.pdf`` なら "
"``sources/reference-en.pdf.typ``\\ 。一冊のビルドでは従来の "
"``_build/pdf/book-<language>.typ`` も確認用に残す。失敗時は公開せず、ソースをエラーに示す "
"``_build/.doctrees/failed`` の場所に残す。複数冊の失敗ソースは別々に保つ。"

#: ../../templates.rst:461
msgid "Writing a new template"
msgstr "新しいテンプレートの作成"

#: ../../templates.rst:464
msgid ""
"Start from the copies quickstart wrote, which show every part in use:"
msgstr "quickstart が書いた、各部分の使い方を示すテンプレートから始めます。"

#: ../../templates.rst:466
msgid ""
"Keep the ``layout.html`` markup that the default style sheet expects, or "
"replace ``_static/guidedog.css`` along with it."
msgstr ""
"既定の CSS が前提とする ``layout.html`` のマークアップを保つか、\\ ``_static/guidedog.css`` "
"も置き換えてください。"

#: ../../templates.rst:468
msgid ""
"Move repeated parts into files of their own and ``include`` them, or put "
"a base layout in ``base.html`` and ``extends`` it from ``layout.html``."
msgstr ""
"繰り返す部分を別ファイルにして ``include`` するか、\\ ``base.html`` を作って ``layout.html`` から "
"``extends`` します。"

#: ../../templates.rst:470
msgid ""
"For the book, change the ``book`` function's rules, or write a new "
"function with the same parameters and keep its name ``book``."
msgstr "本では ``book`` の規則を変えるか、同じ引数を持つ新しい ``book`` 関数を書きます。"

#: ../../templates.rst:473
msgid ""
"Preview with ``guidedog serve`` while editing. Save the source and "
"refresh the browser; the server rebuilds changed inputs before serving "
"the page."
msgstr ""
"編集時は ``guidedog serve`` で確認します。保存してブラウザを更新すると、変更された入力を再ビルドしてからページを返します。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Guidedog renders ``layout.html`` with its own implementation of Jinja, "
#~ "so Jinja's whole language works: ``extends`` and ``block``, "
#~ "``include``, ``import`` and macros, ``set``, ``with``, loops with "
#~ "``loop``, filters, tests, and whitespace control. Output is "
#~ "autoescaped: a variable holding text is escaped, and the variables "
#~ "holding HTML (``body``, ``toc``, and ``outline``) are marked safe "
#~ "already."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Guidedog 独自の Jinja 実装で ``layout.html`` を描画する。\\ ``extends``\\ 、\\ "
#~ "``block``\\ 、\\ ``include``\\ 、\\ ``import``\\ 、マクロ、\\ ``set``\\ 、\\ "
#~ "``with``\\ 、\\ ``loop`` 付きループ、フィルター、テスト、空白制御と、Jinja "
#~ "の全言語を使える。出力は自動エスケープされ、テキスト変数は処理される。HTML の ``body``\\ 、\\ ``toc``\\ 、\\ "
#~ "``outline`` は安全と指定済み。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Guidedog looks for a template in each folder of ``templates_path`` in "
#~ "turn, then among its built-in templates, which are ``layout.html`` "
#~ "only. Templates can extend and include each other by name, so a large "
#~ "layout can be split into parts:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Guidedog は ``templates_path`` の順に探し、その後で組み込みの ``layout.html`` "
#~ "を探す。名前で継承やインクルードができるので、大きなレイアウトを分割できる。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Names are relative to the folders of ``templates_path`` and cannot "
#~ "leave them."
#~ msgstr "テンプレート名は ``templates_path`` の各ディレクトリからの相対名で、その外には出られません。"
